                        <i class="fas fa-glass-cheers"></i>
                        <h3>Groups of friends</h3>
                        <p>Design the ultimate getaway together from wine trips to beach days to culinary adventures.</p>
                        <ul class="bespoke-for-highlights">
                            <li>Private boat days with onboard chefs and DJs</li>
